    {
      "id": "plan_review_en",
      "why": "AiWork's full-screen plan review takes single-key actions (`Run(a)  Revise(m)  Discard(r)  Copy(y)  Close(Esc)`) and reports idle over OSC 7501 while it is open, so typed letters would act on the plan.",
